{"scene_id": "s01908", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01908.fountain", "heading": "INT. GENERATION SHIP OBSERVATION DOME - LATE SHIFT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ELDER MIRIAM ACHTERBERG-OKOYE", "names": ["ELDER MIRIAM ACHTERBERG-OKOYE", "MIRIAM"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 17}, {"id": 1, "name": "JUNE", "names": ["JUNE"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 16}, {"id": 2, "name": "ACHTERBERG-ROSS", "names": ["ACHTERBERG-ROSS"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 3, "name": "SOLIS", "names": ["SOLIS"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 7}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. GENERATION SHIP OBSERVATION DOME - LATE SHIFT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A great curved window opens on a smear of unfamiliar stars.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "The dome is dim, the benches empty.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A faint mechanical sigh from the air handlers.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The far wall is a mural of an Earth long forgotten: green hills, a blue strip of ocean.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "ELDER MIRIAM ACHTERBERG-OKOYE (70s, tall, hands knotted with age, a shawl the color of dried roses) sits on the center bench.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Her granddaughter JUNIPER \"JUNE\" ACHTERBERG-ROSS (20s, engineer's overalls, a spanner in her belt) stands at the window.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "And between them, on the bench, SOLIS (a small cylinder with three glowing rings, the ship's companion unit) hovers.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She says we're a decade out.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I heard.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She says the landing party leaves in a month.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I heard that too.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Elder Achterberg-Okoye. June. Your stress markers have elevated.", "name": "SOLIS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["a chime, then a pleasant voice"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thanks, Solis. I noticed.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The child is nervous, Solis.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She is permitted to be.", "name": "SOLIS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not a child.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're mine.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "June turns from the window.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "The starlight cuts her face in half.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She sits, hard, beside her grandmother, and Solis drifts a polite inch to the left.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gran. Did you know?", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Know what?", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That the planet isn't empty.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who told you?", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["after a pause"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I read the long-range logs. Last night.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Those logs are sealed.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm an engineer. Sealed things are my hobby.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "June has violated Protocol Eleven.", "name": "SOLIS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Solis, shut up.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am only reporting.", "name": "SOLIS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["wounded chime"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Solis, dim the dome.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "The dome dims.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "The stars swell.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Miriam folds her hands.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My mother knew. Her mother knew. It was in the founding charter, in a clause nobody read.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What clause?", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "\"Upon arrival, the descendants shall be prepared to meet the descendants of those who stayed.\"", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Stayed where?", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "On the new world. A second ship left Earth, twenty years before ours. Faster, bolder.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gran. They'd be--", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dead. Yes. And their grandchildren would not.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "June stands abruptly.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Paces.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "The spanner clinks against her belt.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Solis follows at a respectful distance.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So we aren't the first.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We never were.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then why does the council keep saying \"pristine\"?", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because it's easier to land on a pristine world than on someone's home.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "The stars crawl.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Miriam reaches into her shawl and lifts out a small, worn photograph of a woman in a white coat standing by a hill.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's her. My mother. She said: \"If you ever learn the truth, you are to tell the next one.\"", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Me.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "June takes the photograph.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Holds it up to the dark window, where the hills in the picture seem to match, faintly, the shadows on the planet below.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Elder. June. Shall I log this conversation?", "name": "SOLIS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do not.", "name": "MIRIAM", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Understood.", "name": "SOLIS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Solis. Delete the last ten minutes.", "name": "JUNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Deleted.", "name": "SOLIS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "June sits again.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Rests her head on Miriam's shoulder.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Together, the three of them, one a machine, watch the new world roll slowly into view.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}